              "type": "line",
              "character": "Mrs White",
              "text": "He has been at the gate for ten minutes, working up the courage to knock. He is from Maw and Meggins — Herbert's firm.",
              "duration": 9.58,
              "pose": "point"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Mr White",
              "text": "Then why will he not look us in the eye?",
